WEBVTT

00:51:29.542 --> 00:51:32.559
I mean, how many people come
to present to you an enterprise?

00:51:32.583 --> 00:51:33.851
AG: Too many.

00:51:33.875 --> 00:51:36.143
EP: A startup that's about
to change the world.

00:51:36.167 --> 00:51:38.518
AG: It's an immediate red flag
for me, by the way.

00:51:38.542 --> 00:51:39.809
EP: OK, me too.

00:51:39.833 --> 00:51:41.934
AG: I'm like, narcissism defined.

00:51:41.958 --> 00:51:44.559
EP: But why don't you think
of it as passion?

00:51:44.583 --> 00:51:46.809
I mean, you could --
it's an interesting thing.

00:51:46.833 --> 00:51:49.059
But the part of me thinks,

00:51:49.083 --> 00:51:50.559
am I judgmental here?

00:51:50.583 --> 00:51:53.018
Why don't I let
these people think -- you know.

00:51:53.042 --> 00:51:55.059
But big part of it is because --

00:51:55.083 --> 00:51:57.143
did you look at
what the neighbor is doing?

00:51:57.167 --> 00:52:00.643
Do you figure that there's five others
that are doing something similar?